      "item_body": "<p>A professional basketball team plays in an arena that holds 20 000 spectators. Average attendance at each game has been 14 000. The average ticket price is $75. Market research shows that for each $5 reduction in the ticket price, attendance increases by 800. Find the price that will maximize revenue. Enter the price in dollars.</p>",
